---
title: 'Minor Update: Trailblazer Gender Customization and Global Search Enhanced'
---

We are now introducing two minor features: 
1. You can now custom your preferred gender for Trailblazer, which applies to Trailblazer-related content across the site and contents related to the other gender will be hidden then. 
2. We enhanced the Global Search function, which now supports looking for entities by ID. Searching can also be performed on Endgame page now. 
